Package: whence
Type: Package
Title: Explain Where a Number Came from in 'shiny' Apps
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Tanmay",
    family = "Chanda",
    email = "tanmaychanda96@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Lets the viewer of a 'shiny' dashboard click a number and see
    where it came from. The pipeline that makes the number is split into
    its steps. Each step is run in turn, and the number of rows after each
    step is recorded. The result is an attrition waterfall that shows how
    many rows each step removed, together with code that reproduces the
    number. The steps are found from the expression alone, so the pipeline
    does not need to be rewritten. The rows that contribute to the number
    are found only when the viewer asks for them.
